### Error Handling Tests
### 

### 
### 18. Get Non-existent Router (404)
GET {{base_url}}/mikrotik/00000000-0000-0000-0000-999999999999
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 
### 19. Update Non-existent Router (404)
PUT {{base_url}}/mikrotik/00000000-0000-0000-0000-888888888888
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "This should fail"
}

### 
### 20. Delete Non-existent Router (success or 404)
DELETE {{base_url}}/mikrotik/00000000-0000-0000-0000-777777777777
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 
### 21. Test Connection to Non-existent Router (404)
POST {{base_url}}/mikrotik/00000000-0000-0000-0000-666666666666/test
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

